(## 6. Execution, serving and rollback) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Each run gets a fresh container: non-root UID, read-only root, no network, dropped capabilities, no-new-privileges,) Tj T*
(seccomp, PID/CPU/memory limits and a host deadline. Mount only candidate code and bounded scratch; no credentials,) Tj T*
(hidden tests or Docker socket. Preflight verifies enforcement and host-owned audit traces. Shared-kernel containers) Tj T*
(cannot promise immunity to every escape.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Rust async supervision with SQLite atomically reserves maximum billable cost, including reasoning and in-flight) Tj T*
(calls. Persist responses before completion; resume finished keys without new calls. Use bounded retries/failover.) Tj T*
(Lost responses after remote acceptance remain UNKNOWN with reservations retained; reconcile through supported) Tj T*
(provider mechanisms or stop. Exactly-once remote billing is not generally guaranteed.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Serve immutable incumbent/candidate processes locally; health and inference-check both before a 5% gated canary. Log) Tj T*
(checkpoint IDs, latency, errors, verified outcomes and cost. Safety failures or predeclared error thresholds trigger) Tj T*
(atomic routing rollback while requests drain. NO SHIP candidates stay on an evaluation route. Local drills prove) Tj T*
(rollback mechanics; sparse traffic cannot prove quality.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(## 7. Cost assumptions and accounting) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Illustrative USD plan, excluding tax/labour; assumed rates, not quotes or measurements. 96 tasks x three calls,) Tj T*
(averaging 1,500 input/750 output tokens at $1/$4 per million. Hard live budget: $20; reservations use maxima, not) Tj T*
(averages.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(| Line | Assumption | Planned USD |) Tj T*
(| --- | --- | ---: |) Tj T*
(| Teacher generation/evaluation | 288 x \(1,500 x $1 + 750 x $4\) / 1,000,000 | 1.296 |) Tj T*
(| Retry headroom | 25% of teacher spend | 0.324 |) Tj T*
(| Two real adapter runs | 2 x 0.5 GPU-hour x $0.50/hour | 0.500 |) Tj T*
(| Student evaluation | 1 GPU-hour x $0.50/hour | 0.500 |) Tj T*
(| Sandbox/grading | 2 CPU-hours x $0.10/hour | 0.200 |) Tj T*
(| Storage/bundling | Allocated assumption | 0.100 |) Tj T*
(| Total | Capacity plan, not a bill | 2.920 |) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Teacher calls dominate this plan: 7,000 tasks/week implies $94.50 for 21,000 calls before retries/compute; authoring) Tj T*
(labour may dominate total effort. Replace assumptions with actual usage/prices, credits, device-hours and invoices,) Tj T*
(including failures. Export task/model/round costs and amortised serving cost per verified success. Cost per point =) Tj T*
(round cost / gain in percentage points; non-positive gain gives N/A, inconclusive gain gives only a descriptive) Tj T*
(ratio. Keep recorded spend separate from replay API spend \(zero\) and replay compute.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(## What I am not building and why) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(No general coding agent, Kubernetes, pretraining, online RL or web UI: these do not test this bounded loop. Bundle) Tj T*
(real recordings, weights, adapters and runtimes for credential-free offline execution. Internet bootstrap is a) Tj T*
(separate mode; never fabricate missing evidence.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(## Weakest part) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Evaluation power/source diversity: eight held-out source clusters give fragile interval coverage and can miss) Tj T*
(regressions. A working pipeline with NO SHIP pending more sources is credible. Extra tests/seeds improve) Tj T*
(measurement, not independent evidence.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
